From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtl837x-gsw: fix watchdog bounds, MDIO/SDS error checks, and
 SFP teardown

Propagate negative MDIO and SerDes register read errors, fix 9-port RTL8373 PVID array bounds and procfs leaks, bound watchdog recovery, and cancel SFP delayed work on teardown.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
